{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Reuben, my firstborn, you are my strength.</b> My strength was seen at the beginning through you. The firstborn is called ראשית און, and like it, ראשית אונים (Psalms 78:51)." "<b>Exceeding exaltation.</b> You were worthy of preeminence over all, to be exalted." "And ויתר עז is doubled in meaning after the manner of all prophecies, and the meaning of עָז is strong."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:18.176279908Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}